        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠭᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠲᠦᠷᠦ ᠎ᠶᠢ ᠪᠤᠯᠢᠶᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <definition>usurper le trône</definition>
